---
import GalleryImage from '~/assets/images/gallery.png';
---
  <h2><a href="/gallery">おむもふ画廊</a></h2>
  <p>かわいい作品を集めた、リトルのためのやさしいギャラリー。</p>
  <div class="image-wrapper">
    <a href="/gallery" style="display: block; transition: transform 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
      <img 
        src="/assets/images/gallery.png" 
        alt="おむもふ画廊" 
        style="width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(240, 120, 180, 0.25);" 
      />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
